Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 13:06:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Skip empty random-tick sections

Moonrise already skips the inner random-tick loop when a section has
no ticking blocks, but the outer loop still visits every section.
Keep a per-chunk bitset of sections with tickingBlockCount > 0, updated
from LevelChunkSection on 0/non-zero transitions (including recalc).
Sparse chunks iterate set bits in sectionIndex order; dense chunks keep
the linear scan. Empty sections never consumed random-tick RNG.

